# Every launch command ES-DE offers on the Deck, with presses that change the picture without
# writing a save (mostly Start on a title screen; menus are only moved, never confirmed).
# SYSTEM EMULATOR CORE|- FIRST BUTTON... -- ROM-GLOB; see input-check.sh. Wii is absent: Dolphin's
# Wii remotes read the Deck's own controls (its SteamDeck backend), not a pad a test can replay.
gb retroarch gambatte 25 start start -- Tetris (World) (Rev 1).zip
gbc retroarch gambatte 25 start start -- Tetris DX*.zip
gba retroarch mgba 30 start start -- Legend of Zelda, The - The Minish Cap (USA).zip
nes retroarch mesen 25 start -- Super Mario Bros. (World).zip
snes retroarch snes9x 25 start -- Super Mario World (USA).zip
genesis retroarch genesis_plus_gx 25 start -- Sonic The Hedgehog (USA, Europe).zip
n64 retroarch mupen64plus_next 40 start start -- Mario Kart 64 (USA).zip
psx retroarch mednafen_psx 45 start -- Crash Bandicoot (USA).m3u
nds retroarch melonds 40 start -- Legend of Zelda, The - Phantom Hourglass*.zip
nds retroarch desmume 40 start -- Legend of Zelda, The - Phantom Hourglass*.zip
nds melonds - 40 start -- Legend of Zelda, The - Phantom Hourglass*.zip
dreamcast flycast - 40 start -- Crazy Taxi (USA).chd
dreamcast retroarch flycast 40 start -- Crazy Taxi (USA).chd
psp ppsspp - 45 start -- Daxter*.iso
psp retroarch ppsspp 45 start -- Daxter*.iso
